    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's more than just doubt though. it's like a weight. i spent decades trying to build something that mattered, and now that i'm looking at it, i see how hollow it is. it feels like i've been running a race toward a cliff. i'm just so incredibly tired of pretending that any of it matters. it's just exhausting to keep performing this role of a person with a purpose when there isn't one.",
